            </style></head><body><div xmlns="" class="page-wrapper"><h2 class="auth__title">Приказ (распоряжения) о направлении работника в командировку</h2><div class="page-box" id="doc-box"><div class="doc-page"><div id="documentConftent" class="content content-form"><div><table width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:center;  vertical-align:top"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr1/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfas00aryu/" data-dfa="dfas00aryu"></a>ООО «Карвон»</span></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:center;  vertical-align:top"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr2/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasvx1hqx/" data-dfa="dfasvx1hqx"></a><strong>&nbsp;</strong></td></tr><tr><td style="width:639pt"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr3/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasir7x1t/" data-dfa="dfasir7x1t"></a>&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style="margin-right:19pt; text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr4/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfas4b3pvz/" data-dfa="dfas4b3pvz"></a><strong>ПРИКАЗ № </strong><span class="fill">26-к</span></p><div><table width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:center;  vertical-align:top"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr5/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfash67vqf/" data-dfa="dfash67vqf"></a>г.</td><td style="text-align:left;  vertical-align:top"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr6/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasvd2qrh/" data-dfa="dfasvd2qrh"></a>Ташкент</span></td><td style="text-align:center;  vertical-align:top"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr7/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasn3iboh/" data-dfa="dfasn3iboh"></a>&nbsp;</span></td><td style="text-align:left;  vertical-align:top"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr8/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasrvbz5v/" data-dfa="dfasrvbz5v"></a><strong>«</strong></td><td style="text-align:center;  vertical-align:top"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr9/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasshf9td/" data-dfa="dfasshf9td"></a>07</span></td><td style="text-align:left;  vertical-align:top"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr10/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasi7v213/" data-dfa="dfasi7v213"></a><strong>»</strong></td><td style="text-align:center;  vertical-align:top"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr11/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfaskq8cds/" data-dfa="dfaskq8cds"></a>апреля</span></td><td style="text-align:right;  vertical-align:top"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr12/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasrose2h/" data-dfa="dfasrose2h"></a>20</td><td style="text-align:center;  vertical-align:top"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr13/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasu3dg3h/" data-dfa="dfasu3dg3h"></a>19</span></td><td style="text-align:left;  vertical-align:top"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr14/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfastel17a/" data-dfa="dfastel17a"></a>года</td></tr><tr><td style="width:24pt"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr15/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasnggtb4/" data-dfa="dfasnggtb4"></a>&nbsp;</td><td style="width:79pt"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr16/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasemsrst/" data-dfa="dfasemsrst"></a>&nbsp;</td><td style="width:271pt"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr17/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfascg7hwg/" data-dfa="dfascg7hwg"></a>&nbsp;</td><td style="width:22pt"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr18/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfas1gyao7/" data-dfa="dfas1gyao7"></a>&nbsp;</td><td style="width:30pt"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr19/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasm9xggf/" data-dfa="dfasm9xggf"></a>&nbsp;</td><td style="width:19pt"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr20/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasxqpuga/" data-dfa="dfasxqpuga"></a>&nbsp;</td><td style="width:84pt"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr21/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfas9fzy7r/" data-dfa="dfas9fzy7r"></a>&nbsp;</td><td style="width:30pt"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr22/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasu89eq2/" data-dfa="dfasu89eq2"></a>&nbsp;</td><td style="width:30pt"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr23/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasghqp2r/" data-dfa="dfasghqp2r"></a>&nbsp;</td><td style="width:48pt"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr24/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasxwp8p1/" data-dfa="dfasxwp8p1"></a>&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style="margin-right:19pt"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr25/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasappp98/" data-dfa="dfasappp98"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style="margin-right:19pt"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr26/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasyd0gsp/" data-dfa="dfasyd0gsp"></a>Кабаева Икрама Исаковича</span> - <span class="fill">аудитора ООО «Карвон»</span> направить в командировку в г.<br><span class="fill">Самарканд</span> с <span class="fill">10 апреля 2019 года</span> сроком на <span class="fill">18</span> календарных дней для выполнения контракта<br>№ <span class="fill">458-ВА</span> на <span class="fill">проведение аудита</span>.</p><p style="margin-right:19pt"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr27/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasnpeg75/" data-dfa="dfasnpeg75"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style="margin-right:19pt"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr28/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasu3y7w9/" data-dfa="dfasu3y7w9"></a>Основание: Служебная записка начальника отдела внешнего аудита <span class="fill">Юсупова О.И.</span> от<br><span class="fill">03.04.2017 года</span>.</p><p style="margin-right:19pt"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr29/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfaszyvywd/" data-dfa="dfaszyvywd"></a>&nbsp;</p><div><table width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="vertical-align:top"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr30/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfaszqqmub/" data-dfa="dfaszqqmub"></a>Генеральный директор</td><td style="vertical-align:top"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr31/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasob9eu1/" data-dfa="dfasob9eu1"></a>&nbsp;</td><td class="bdBottom" style="text-align:center;  vertical-align:top"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr32/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasr7g2hq/" data-dfa="dfasr7g2hq"></a>Вахидов</span></td><td style="vertical-align:top"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr33/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasqtdgl5/" data-dfa="dfasqtdgl5"></a>&nbsp;</td><td class="bdBottom" style="text-align:center;  vertical-align:top"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr34/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasvq2mcp/" data-dfa="dfasvq2mcp"></a>К. Вахидов</span></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:top"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr35/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfas4t134g/" data-dfa="dfas4t134g"></a>&nbsp;</td><td style="vertical-align:top"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr36/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfas5y9gdr/" data-dfa="dfas5y9gdr"></a>&nbsp;</td><td class="bdTop" style="text-align:center;  vertical-align:top"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr37/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfas0guz24/" data-dfa="dfas0guz24"></a><sup>(подпись)</sup></td><td style="vertical-align:top"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr38/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasrb2rdv/" data-dfa="dfasrb2rdv"></a>&nbsp;</td><td class="bdTop" style="text-align:center;  vertical-align:top"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr39/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfas2rne5a/" data-dfa="dfas2rne5a"></a><sup>(Ф.И.О.)</sup></td></tr><tr><td style="width:209pt"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr40/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasholg2x/" data-dfa="dfasholg2x"></a>&nbsp;</td><td style="width:38pt"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr41/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfas3xaqp5/" data-dfa="dfas3xaqp5"></a>&nbsp;</td><td style="width:177pt"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr42/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfas76zne2/" data-dfa="dfas76zne2"></a>&nbsp;</td><td style="width:38pt"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr43/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfaskgfixa/" data-dfa="dfaskgfixa"></a>&nbsp;</td><td style="width:180pt"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr44/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfass0p5bq/" data-dfa="dfass0p5bq"></a>&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style="margin-right:19pt"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr45/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfas7685xy/" data-dfa="dfas7685xy"></a>С приказом ознакомлен:</p><div><table width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="vertical-align:top"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr46/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasgg8eg4/" data-dfa="dfasgg8eg4"></a>И.И. Кабаев</span></td><td style="vertical-align:top"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr47/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasr5kc77/" data-dfa="dfasr5kc77"></a>&nbsp;</td><td class="bdBottom" style="text-align:center;  vertical-align:top"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr48/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/dfasev607b/" data-dfa="dfasev607b"></a>Кабаев</span></td><td style="vertical-align:top"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201404/bssPhr49/"></a><a data-anch